{'symbol': 'BAC', 'date': '2021-06-08 16:15:00', 'title': 'BANK OF AMERICA ANNOUNCES REDEMPTION OF FLOATING RATE SENIOR NOTES, DUE JUNE 2022', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--BANK OF AMERICA CORPORATION ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT WILL REDEEM ON JUNE 25, 2021 ALL $850,000,000 PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OUTSTANDING OF ITS FLOATING RATE SENIOR NOTES, DUE JUNE 2022 (CUSIP NO. 06051GHJ1) (THE “NOTES”). THE REDEMPTION PRICE FOR THE NOTES WILL BE EQUAL TO 100% OF THE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF THE NOTES, PLUS ACCRUED AND UNPAID INTEREST TO, BUT EXCLUDING, THE REDEMPTION DATE OF JUNE 25, 2021. INTEREST ON THE NOTES WILL CEASE TO ACCRUE ON THE REDEMPTION DATE.'}